        "message": "=Hi {{ $('Webhook - New Lead Intake').item.json.body.full_name }}, \nThanks for reaching out! To help us assist you better, could you share:  \n1. What are you hoping to solve or get help with? \n2. When are you looking to get started — this month, this quarter, or just exploring? \n3. Do you have a budget range in mind? \n4. Are you the one making the final call, or will others be involved?\n\nFeel free to just reply to this email with your answers.\n{{ $('Set - Business Info').item.json.business_name }}.\n",
